_ohc=gV_u49Bcy-MQ7kNvwFh-dkn&_nc_oc=AdqdpLzXv-q78inGYs1GlWqBDEYxUh1tFJYKanoxqswuQtigcWpVFC4sG_pNqvGXBK4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6xx548oogyNeAC-CUhtvORM3TUVCtFfSdlqXvsKIeMIQ&oe=6A08666F"}, {"file_name": "\u622a\u57162.png", "id": "2087193361730451", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75462203_2087193365063784_862658085619166334_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=WdnXOZzm5rsQ7kNvwHchqEF&_nc_oc=Adp-BEv2sc1WALK7EGc43hPGoaYArKxvCB_EDjz8S2_V4AvPhtHyiLlgBEVwlUF4vPM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6gilc_1a0y9hqHMSKFjj3ZmKLrKOUtlA8RNJ_uUkuTVQ&oe=6A0882A7"}, {"file_name": "\u622a\u57163.png", "id": "565742826430110", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031337_565742829763443_2348743012161439434_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Mww5qT_VcKgQ7kNvwEJN_EF&_nc_oc=AdqoGfYBC4LXi8EKVjdTNYJFvA088TU6j6MfwMHkYlkbc-adFaD1pQSLN3ASwl8FtbA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6kaoTVNOPgUMA3kb_7g3PmM-IRklEhtqzcQn8icxyYpQ&oe=6A0861D1"}, {"file_name": "\u622a\u57164.png", "id": "457325230760902", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75485575_457325234094235_6559372112880837045_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=eFpr9aeEZ5YQ7kNvwEafiwd&_nc_oc=AdpXCoqnmh4yHmXITzXvbvlSheoeSLADG-drDHT-aNICThQfmg_fhvl0tXo027hDAy8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af60liy2oioNPmIrBCY4NAN_QWzeEhI2j9dAw9qi7tjxuA&oe=6A088467"}, {"file_name": "\u622a\u57165.png", "id": "2043351619496913", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031437_2043351622830246_8775906402630274259_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ECvIxPW3rysQ7kNvwF4wisx&_nc_oc=Adoa0D0aW7HRpNDxV-sYLcPxr0ZMYCn9QcByDl_cyUAPwKi3NuN0jxrALPR_1mYyOPk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4M9grQylRz1yENuj9_gOh2X0A-79hmBMFonHBhZQqx_A&oe=6A087347"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "ExitToilet", "keywords": ["escape", "puzzles", "inference"], "long_description": "Game Description\nThe CEO of a biotech company mysteriously vanishes one morning. As a determined journalist, you sneak into his mansion to investigate, only to find yourself trapped in a creepy bathroom. Each clue and puzzle brings you closer to uncovering the truth\u2014but the deeper you go, the darker the secrets become.\n\nThis escape room is a test of wit, courage, and observation. Solve puzzles, uncover a sinister conspiracy, and escape before time runs out.\n\nGame Features\nGripping Narrative: A story full of twists and hidden secrets.\nImmersive Environment: Tense atmosphere with detailed designs and sound.\nChallenging Puzzles: Solve intricate puzzles with keen observation.\nPsychological Tension: Every revelation brings more danger.\nComplete VR Experience: Intense first-person perspective.\n\nGameplay\nExplore and Observe: Examine the environment for clues.\nSolve Puzzles: Unlock barriers and piece together the mystery.\nUncover the Truth: Discover the secrets behind the CEO\u2019s disappearance.\nSurvive and Escape: Stay calm and find the way out.\n\nIdeal Players\nFans of mystery and puzzles.\nThrill-seekers looking for a chilling experience.\nThose who enjoy story-driven gameplay.\nReady to face your fears and uncover the truth? The challenge awaits!\n\nControls\nHold the A button to move.\nPress the grab button to interact with objects.", "short_description": "The CEO of a biotech giant vanishes mysteriously during his commute, shocking the world. As a journalist, you sneak into his mansion for answers but become trapped in a chilling bathroom full of secrets.\n\nThis isn\u2019t just an escape room\u2014it\u2019s a test of wit and courage. Solve puzzles, uncover clues, and reveal the dark truth behind the CEO\u2019s disappearance. Face your fears, escape, and expose a conspiracy that will shake the world.\n"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "LOGO.png", "id": "2597103487166681", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/86625129_2597103490500014_3922643013080904156_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=c_CuLOlLBLQQ7kNvwFmFVvl&_nc_oc=AdqhsTlhp3HaW4mGy3se5tZB2wG5u3IBrNdxKgQL-F4y1AIviYPQ-EWVGtnUAlwgHz8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4DH4FdXYgeHZzTSW7OIsFovBcbyIsUmu_jRllMP0ccYQ&oe=6A088144"}, {"file_name": "1008x1440.png", "id": "1182949610072593", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75392232_1182949613405926_2898506178213785049_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_nYA4C9RqNMQ7kNvwFwNKAc&_nc_oc=Adqd_fsWyGdq7SpVNeuEyx1bM7cM5QHs7QXLgwVAPQXCjEofCMDui7hLOyewvZO5lrg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af75VAcwT37oP24ZvTqaJ9Ujfnqw1XHRz0h8iligG7w-tQ&oe=6A088F36"}, {"file_name": "1080x360.png", "id": "1144873710614671", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031548_1144873713948004_7837426084537891215_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_0BfrR1ibdAQ7kNvwHmh2eV&_nc_oc=AdoLblKYkb-NiYxL8ACgaYPzo1Oy_szhgWWz6tkILHtSU48Jz_3bF-4XO_JzrM00gI4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6pvhQjCNEruC4WCQYGzdE939-fo-s6lzRdRNmFZfFMkw&oe=6A08928D"}, {"file_name": "LOGO.png", "id": "1133433471817081", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75375772_1133433475150414_1715205268410684577_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=N2ZEftrvfjIQ7kNvwEGCLps&_nc_oc=Adrxq4-Rx2ZKFpbGwnD0MBZBANRUc5e6A4cfcO3gqRUMvQBKm_AVCnnfLU54gHhQmfo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5ZEli4tjTzX7NUGdw5BUSavxVmiaH4DKZG_SZzD6VOzg&oe=6A085F01"}, {"file_name": "3000x900.png", "id": "930390195865438", "image_type": "APP_I